  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312068/description_65b362b3-2a12-44a1-92e1-0f6b21a8614a.png\" alt=\"武器与战术横幅\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<p>这是为“<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classic Guns: Zero</a>”打造的枪械包，添加了受 Void Interactive 开发的游戏《Ready or Not》启发的火器。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>非模组版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-weapons-and-tactics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[TaCZ] 武器与战术</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero/files/8141310\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>从 0.3.1 版本起，必须安装 TaCZ 1.1.8！</strong></span></a></p>\n<p>现已发布</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1411291/description_9edb56d8-d5ad-4aa8-b820-55d8e4f3de71.png\"></p>\n<p>非常重要：此项目为模组（Mod）版本。另一个则是该项目的 ZIP 整合包版本！！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>宣传视频：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nv6jIeGWpKw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nv6jIeGWpKw</a></p>\n<p>实机视频：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aXX3R3uoKzc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aXX3R3uoKzc</a></p>\n<p><br><strong>感谢 45 万次下载！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>模组添加了什么？</h2>\n<p>目前包含：</p>\n<h3>48 种枪械：</h3>\n<p>(590M 霰弹枪</p>\n<p>LVAR</p>\n<p>M32A1</p>\n<p>M1014</p>\n<p>MK17</p>\n<p>MK-V</p>\n<p>MP5A2</p>\n<p>P99</p>\n<p>TRPL</p>\n<p>B1301</p>\n<p>)</p>\n<h3><br>13 种配件：</h3>\n<p>(4 种握把</p>\n<p>3 种激光指示器</p>\n<p>2 种枪口装置</p>\n<p>3 种瞄具</p>\n<p>1 种枪托)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>9 种弹药类型：</h3>\n<p>(.68 胡椒球弹</p>\n<p>.300 Blackout</p>\n<p>6.5x48 Creedmoor</p>\n<p>7.62x51mm</p>\n<p>10mm</p>\n<p>豆袋弹</p>\n<p>易碎弹头</p>\n<p>9mm 训练弹</p>\n<p>5.56x45mm 训练弹)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>（无限弹药版本将于 v1.0 随附推出）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>安装方法：</h2>\n<p>只需点击安装并选择你的游戏实例，版本将自动下载。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>灵感来源：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://voidinteractive.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://voidinteractive.net</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>特别鸣谢：</h2>\n<p>感谢 KohRyü 协助制作动画</p>\n<p>感谢 Tweedlex 提供缩略图</p>\n<p>感谢我的朋友们参与测试</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a style=\"font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-size:16px\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ScoredCupid2710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1312068/description_1a66871b-342c-4d62-889e-190e2c83593f.png\" alt=\"社交媒体横幅\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></h2>",
